# Freehaven does not require any build-time environment variables.
#
# - No API keys are bundled. A remote AI/STT/TTS provider is configured at
#   runtime in Settings and the key is stored in the device keychain
#   (expo-secure-store).
# - CI uses only the public Android SDK and the checked-in lockfile.
#
# If a future integration needs build-time configuration, add an
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* variable here and document it in docs/CONFIGURATION.md.
# Never commit a real .env file.
